silm:instances_papers_15_chapters_06_sections_01_concrete_anchor_4#circuitfivecorner silm:hasLongDescription "The CircuitFiveCorner is Circuit 5: neurosomatic-individual-terrestrial. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'corner_5', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
